<title>USA: Missouri jobless rate jumps to 4.4 percent in Dec..</title>
<headline>Missouri jobless rate jumps to 4.4 percent in Dec..</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-01-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Missouri's unemployment rate rose to 4.4 percent in December, up from four percent in November, the state's department of labor and industrial relations reported Friday.</p>
<p>The department estimated that 125,800 workers were without jobs in December, 9,200 more than in November.</p>
<p>The jump in the jobless was blamed in part on winter weather hinering employment in weather-sensitive industries and to seasonal effects in tourism and other sectors.</p>
<p>((--Karen Pierog, 312-408-8647))</p>
